' Relationships - User Management
User "1" -- "0..1" UserRole : has role >
User "1" -- "*" Case : creates >
User "1" -- "*" AudioFile : uploads >
User "1" -- "*" Task : owns >
User "1" -- "*" CaseParticipant : participates >
User "1" -- "*" ActivityLog : performs >

' Relationships - Case Management
Case "1" -- "0..1" CaseStatus : has status >
Case "1" -- "0..1" CasePriority : has priority >
Case "1" -- "*" CaseParticipant : has participants >
Case "1" -- "*" AudioFile : contains >
Case "1" -- "*" CaseNote : has notes >
Case "1" -- "*" Summary : has summaries >
Case "1" -- "*" ActivityLog : tracks activities >

CaseParticipant "*" -- "1" ParticipantRole : has role >

' Relationships - Audio Processing
AudioFile "1" -- "0..1" Task : has task >
AudioFile "*" -- "1" Language : in language >
AudioFile "*" -- "0..1" AudioStatus : has status >
AudioFile "1" -- "0..1" Transcription : has transcription >
AudioFile "1" -- "0..1" AnalysisResult : has analysis >
AudioFile "1" -- "*" CaseNote : referenced in >
AudioFile "1" -- "*" ActivityLog : tracks activities >

' Relationships - Task Processing
Task "1" -- "*" AudioFile : processes >
Task "1" -- "*" Transcription : produces >
Task "1" -- "*" AnalysisResult : produces >
Task "1" -- "*" ActivityLog : logs activities >

' Relationships - Analysis
Transcription "*" -- "1" Language : in language >
AnalysisResult "*" -- "0..1" Sentiment : has sentiment >
AnalysisResult "1" -- "*" AnalysisDetail : contains details >

' Relationships - Activity Logging
ActivityLog "*" -- "1" ActivityType : of type >

note right of Task
  **Central Task Model**

  Stores all processing results in JSONB format.
  This flexible approach allows:
  - Easy schema evolution
  - Fast queries with GIN indexes
  - Reduced database complexity
  - Version control of results

  Key fields in result JSONB:
  - transcription: Full transcript text
  - summary: Summary text
  - segments: Timestamped segments with speakers
  - context_analysis: Multi-layer analysis
    - entities, relationships, actions
    - anomalies, risks, insights
  - visualization_data: Knowledge graph
    - nodes, edges, timeline
end note

note right of AudioFile
  **Audio File Management**

  Supports multiple storage backends:
  - local: Local filesystem (default)
  - s3: AWS S3
  - gcs: Google Cloud Storage

  Methods:
  - archive(): Move to archive directory
  - restore(): Restore from archive
  - delete_file(): Permanently delete

  Properties:
  - absolute_path: Computed full path
  - exists: Check if file exists
end note

note left of Case
  **Case-centric Model**

  Each case can contain:
  - Multiple audio files
  - Multiple participants with roles
  - Notes (private/public)
  - Summaries (individual/multi-file)
  - Full activity audit trail

  Supports:
  - Archiving with reason
  - Status workflow
  - Priority management
  - Metadata extensibility (JSON)
end note

note bottom of AnalysisResult
  **Multi-version Analysis**

  Allows multiple analysis versions
  for the same audio file:
  - Version 1: Initial analysis
  - Version 2: Re-analysis with different model
  - Version 3: Manual corrections

  Unique constraint: (audio_id, version)
end note

@enduml
